#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:5
#: e600245de27f440aaeb7fd6c1adf452a
msgid "Learning ArduPilot — Introduction"
msgstr "学习 ArduPilot —— 简介"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:7
#: 254b501a8dd84277850f7ea7a704a02b
msgid ""
"This page introduces the basic structure of ArduPilot. Before you get "
"started you should work out what code exploring system you will use. You "
"could just use a web browser and look at "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/ but you will probably get a lot more"
" out of it if you have :ref:`cloned all of the git repositories <where-to-"
"get-the-code>` and use a good programmer's IDE like the ones recommended "
":ref:`here <code-editing-tools-and-ides>`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍 ArduPilot 的基本结构。开始之前，您应该确定将使用何种代码浏览工具。您可以直接使用网络浏览器访问 "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/，但如果您已 :ref:`克隆所有 git 仓库 <where-to-"
"get-the-code>` 并使用 :ref:`此处 <code-editing-tools-and-ides>` 推荐的优质开发者 "
"IDE，收获将会更多。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:13
#: 0f55ef7213594cd8ba16666e21a434fc
msgid "Basic structure"
msgstr "基本结构"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:18
#: fce9c97eeb83438db49aa12ff4da9f01
msgid "The basic structure of ArduPilot is broken up into 5 main parts:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 的基本结构分为 5 个主要部分："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:20
#: d82f358c2a814937b7532fcd17821035
msgid "vehicle code"
msgstr "飞行器代码"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:21
#: 8dbb11d4fb7a438aa6b624ce1bee59ed
msgid "shared libraries"
msgstr "共享库"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:22
#: 707dfa30b4cb4d3f8bc47db35408c2c5
msgid "hardware abstraction layer (AP_HAL)"
msgstr "硬件抽象层（AP_HAL）"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:23
#: 18264a07f461441697295e1b94ee7e01
msgid "tools directories"
msgstr "工具目录"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:24
#: b29730f5d8a64928ab3987db2e2b300e
msgid "external support code (e.g. mavlink)"
msgstr "外部支持代码（如 mavlink）"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:27
#: 56440da2a8084cbe8f5f2049f1ad5759
msgid "Vehicle Code"
msgstr "飞行器代码"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:29
#: 94621ead909547e3afdc5cb7196c2fbb
msgid ""
"The vehicle directories are the top level directories that define the "
"firmware for each vehicle type.  Currently, there are 6 vehicle types: "
"Plane, Copter, Rover, Sub, Blimp and AntennaTracker. Although there are a "
"lot of common elements between different vehicle types, they are each "
"different. For now, we only have a :ref:`detailed description of the code "
"structure for the Copter code <apmcopter-code-overview>`."
msgstr ""
"飞行器目录是定义各类飞行器固件的顶级目录。目前共有 6 "
"种飞行器类型：Plane（固定翼）、Copter（多旋翼）、Rover（地面车辆）、Sub（水下机器人）、Blimp（飞艇）和 "
"AntennaTracker（天线跟踪器）。尽管不同飞行器类型之间有很多共同元素，但各有不同。目前，我们仅有 :ref:`Copter "
"代码结构的详细说明 <apmcopter-code-overview>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:33
#: 04365602ffcf4485a08c83cbe4c9fc03
msgid ""
"Along with the \\*.cpp files, each vehicle directory contains a wscript file"
" which lists library dependencies."
msgstr "除 \\*.cpp 文件外，每个飞行器目录还包含一个 wscript 文件，列出了库依赖关系。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:37
#: 3e9baf70db0447e0a260e98e30deb033
msgid "Libraries"
msgstr "库"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:39
#: ccfbef1a83624adab30537fe8c7aee55
msgid ""
"The `libraries "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries>`__ are shared"
" amongst all vehicle types.  These libraries include sensor drivers, "
"attitude and position estimation (aka :ref:`EKF <ekf>`) and control code "
"(i.e. PID controllers). See the :ref:`Library Description <apmcopter-"
"programming-libraries>`, :ref:`Library Example Sketches <learning-ardupilot-"
"the-example-sketches>` and :ref:`Sensor Drivers <code-overview-sensor-"
"drivers>` pages for more details."
msgstr ""
"`库 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries>`__ "
"在所有飞行器类型之间共享。这些库包括传感器驱动、姿态和位置估计（即 :ref:`EKF <ekf>`）以及控制代码（如 PID 控制器）。更多详情请参阅"
" :ref:`库说明 <apmcopter-programming-libraries>`、:ref:`库示例草图 <learning-"
"ardupilot-the-example-sketches>` 和 :ref:`传感器驱动 <code-overview-sensor-"
"drivers>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:44
#: 3761474595634d3890a9c0b141589ea2
msgid "AP_HAL"
msgstr "AP_HAL"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:46
#: b408d75140dc472ba4d434e2b3e98aa5
msgid ""
"The AP_HAL layer (Hardware Abstraction Layer) is how we make ArduPilot "
"portable to lots of different platforms. There is a top-level AP_HAL in "
"libraries/AP_HAL that defines the interface that the rest of the code has to"
" specific board features, and then there is a AP_HAL_XXX subdirectory for "
"each board type, for example, AP_HAL_ChibiOS for stm32-based boards, "
"AP_HAL_ESP32 for ESP32 boards and AP_HAL_Linux for Linux based boards."
msgstr ""
"AP_HAL 层（硬件抽象层）使 ArduPilot 能够移植到众多不同平台。libraries/AP_HAL 中有一个顶层 "
"AP_HAL，定义了代码其余部分对特定主板功能的接口，然后每种主板类型对应一个 AP_HAL_XXX 子目录，例如，AP_HAL_ChibiOS "
"用于基于 stm32 的主板，AP_HAL_ESP32 用于 ESP32 主板，AP_HAL_Linux 用于基于 Linux 的主板。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:55
#: c8ce65dc75c342b585d11d4670433b7f
msgid "Tools directories"
msgstr "工具目录"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:57
#: 27ac101945e643d48df7b477d85d7cd5
msgid ""
"The tools directories are miscellaneous support directories. For example, "
"tools/autotest provides the autotest infrastructure behind the "
"`autotest.ardupilot.org <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ site and "
"tools/Replay provides our log replay utility."
msgstr ""
"工具目录是各类支持目录。例如，tools/autotest 提供 `autotest.ardupilot.org "
"<https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ 网站背后的自动化测试基础设施，tools/Replay 提供日志回放工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:63
#: e102fe1652a641b3bf631a363c421d0a
msgid "External support code"
msgstr "外部支持代码"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:65
#: aa3ec9586f0948619f374c20eb74e25d
msgid ""
"On some platforms we need external support code to provide additional "
"features or board support. Currently the external trees are:"
msgstr "在某些平台上，我们需要外部支持代码以提供额外功能或主板支持。目前的外部代码树包括："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:68
#: aac721c310c94e65a3f7bf7c8893bff4
msgid ""
"`ChibiOS <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ChibiOS>`__ - the ChibiOS RTOS used "
"on stm32-based boards"
msgstr ""
"`ChibiOS <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ChibiOS>`__ —— 用于基于 stm32 主板的 ChibiOS"
" 实时操作系统"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:70
#: 312ee3b010b14687bd79a496f622d53f
msgid ""
"`DroneCAN <https://github.com/DroneCAN>`__ - the CANBUS implementation used "
"in ArduPilot"
msgstr ""
"`DroneCAN <https://github.com/DroneCAN>`__ —— ArduPilot 中使用的 CANBUS 实现"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:72
#: 7b03beb858244992a45610c121b3aada
msgid ""
"`mavlink <https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink>`__ - the mavlink protocol "
"and code generator"
msgstr ""
"`mavlink <https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink>`__ —— MAVLink 协议及代码生成器"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-introduction.rst:77
#: d05ca620c2eb43fbb26f618390413a9f
msgid ""
"Most of these are imported as :ref:`Git Submodules <git-submodules>` when "
"you :ref:`build ArduPilot <building-the-code>`."
msgstr ""
"其中大多数在您 :ref:`构建 ArduPilot <building-the-code>` 时作为 :ref:`Git 子模块 <git-"
"submodules>` 导入。"
